        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP 896V-36, 5 x 1/2 x 96 Bumper Threshold</b>\r\n<p>\r\n5\" wide x 1/2\" high x 96\" length aluminum ADA compliant bumper threshold.  These 96 inch long bumper thresholds are made from non rusting T5 aluminum alloy and used for sealing the door bottom. <b>Allow 3/8\" bottom door clearance.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nField sizable, non-handed, optional Anodized Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish.  .  Packaged with #10 flat head zinc plated wood screws. Fluted top with typical wall thickness of .105\". Ramped on both sides for easy access, ADA compliant. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available  <a href=\"/products/5-x-1-2-x-36-bumper-threshold-ngp-896v-36\"><b>3 Foot Bumper Threshold</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/5-x-1-2-x-48-bumper-threshold-ngp-896v-48\"><b>4 Foot Bumper Threshold</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/5-x-1-2-x-72-bumper-threshold-ngp-896v-72\"><b>6 Foot Bumper Threshold</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP 896V-96 96\" Bumper Threshold\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 96\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Thickness: .105 (3/32\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: T5 aluminum alloy</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Anodized Aluminum  </li>\r\n<li>Weather Seal: Gray Vinyl</li>\r\n<li>Installation Screws: #10 x 1-1/2\" FH Zinc Plated Wood Screws</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
